# Copy this file to .env (same folder). Nothing here is secret: it ends up in
# the public website. Never put passwords or API keys in this file.

# Where the lead form and the pop-up send sign-ups. Any service that accepts a
# normal HTML form POST works (Formspree, Tally, Basin, Getform...). Paste the
# form URL it gives you. Empty = the form shows "not connected yet".
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
